// Reduce la respuesta de Quote/product a lo esencial y aplica el filtro de precio máximo (opcional).
const resp = $input.first().json;
const maxUsd = parseFloat($('Datos del Viaje').first().json.max_usd || '');

const planes = (resp.data?.quotedProducts || []).map(p => {
  const amt = p.amount || {};
  const loc = p.localAmount || {};
  return {
    productCode: p.productCode,
    rateCode: p.rateCode,
    name: p.name,
    modality: p.modality,
    description: p.rateCaption || p.description,
    total: amt.total,
    currency: p.currency,
    localTotal: loc.total,
    localCurrency: loc.currency,
    coberturasPdf: p.coverageDetails,
  };
});

const filtrados = planes
  .filter(p => !Number.isFinite(maxUsd) || (p.currency === 'USD' && p.total != null && p.total <= maxUsd))
  .sort((a, b) => (a.total ?? Infinity) - (b.total ?? Infinity));

return filtrados.map(p => ({ json: p }));
